WEBVTT

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.351
waiting for food with not enough
supply to go around.

00:00:30.375 --> 00:00:34.809
"How is it possible these two photos
exist at the same time,

00:00:34.833 --> 00:00:36.101
in the most prosperous

00:00:36.125 --> 00:00:40.393
and technologically advanced
moment in our history," tweeted Andrés.

00:00:40.417 --> 00:00:43.559
In the months after
the photos were published,

00:00:43.583 --> 00:00:45.292
the crisis got worse.

00:00:46.208 --> 00:00:49.309
Billions of pounds of potatoes
and other fresh produce

00:00:49.333 --> 00:00:51.809
were chucked by American farmers.

00:00:51.833 --> 00:00:53.101
At the same time,

00:00:53.125 --> 00:00:56.078
food banks all over the country
were reporting demand increases

00:00:56.102 --> 00:00:59.768
and 40 percent were facing
critical shortfalls.

00:00:59.792 --> 00:01:01.393
Outside the US,